CHAPTER.VERS:
And Saul said to the Kenites, Go, depart, go

          {+}
         down from among the Amalekites, or else I will destroy you

          {+}
         with them; for you

          {+}
         showed kindness to all the sons of Israel, when they came up out of Egypt. So the Kenites departed from among the Amalekites.

Then Samuel said, Bring

          {+}
         here to me Agag the king of the Amalekites. And Agag came to him cheerfully. And Agag said, Surely the bitterness of death is past.
